From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 18:21:46 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 185/220] [ae-patch] Archive a family's sessions with its lead
 from the chat header too

Patch 0184 made Archive on a lead's sidebar row archive every session under it, asking first while one is open. The chat header's Archive still archived the lead alone, leaving its helpers running. The header now uses the same cascade; it has no sidebar tree, so it reads the session list to learn whether the session leads a family, and archives it alone when it does not.
